### Créer un utilisateur
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Admin",
  "prenom": "Super",
  "email": "admin@upgc.com",
  "motDePasse": "admin123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### Se connecter
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@upgc.com",
  "motDePasse": "admin123"
}